      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you aren't a doctor but im just trying to figure out if this is something i can handle at home for now. the pain is sharp but it's also kinda dull and comes in waves, so maybe it's just gas or something? if i take a strong laxative or some peppermint oil, do you think that would help clear it up faster? i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to.",
